{"page":20016,"part":1,"text":"处戈章第五\n\n\n处戈章第五\n\n夫斫戈之法，落竿峨峨，如开松之倚溪谷，似欲倒也，复似百钧之弩初张。处其戈意，妙理难穷。放似弓张箭发，收似虎斗龙跃，直如临谷之劲松，曲类悬钩之钓水。崚嶒切于云汉，倒载陨于山崖。天门腾而地户跃，四海谧而五岳封；玉烛明而日月蔽，绣彩乱而锦纹翻。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20016,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"d5025c64c8016014844255b444656fdd85ed6b26fcc49846a0216f6096ca45bf","textSha256":"d5025c64c8016014844255b444656fdd85ed6b26fcc49846a0216f6096ca45bf","fileSha256":"d5025c64c8016014844255b444656fdd85ed6b26fcc49846a0216f6096ca45bf","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20016-work-021.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"笔势论十二章 并序 · 处戈章第五","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/7wKzKkqEtPksjBUcmK1gfa","originalPages":[44],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":6,"sourceTextSha256":"e0a11b2071b48ef885d657fda49a436b907aa3b8cde46598396dca1b61074907","id":"local-44-141-153","page_id":44,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":141,"rawEnd":153,"reviewedTextSha256":"af0e9b59082edeb0a97eb80ee69199a3171ac7c4466f3ace418ae528844e661c","displayUnitOrigins":[[147,148],[148,149],[149,150],[150,151],[151,152],[152,153]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":44,"part":1,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"肖源","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T07:41:22.408Z","revision":"af0e9b59082edeb0a97eb80ee69199a3171ac7c4466f3ace418ae528844e661c","textSha256":"af0e9b59082edeb0a97eb80ee69199a3171ac7c4466f3ace418ae528844e661c","fileSha256":"79106ac65424604a53ca79186ecc2bad7dbbdc92135f4d626b3d9b63cebb6e55","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":8,"end":13,"sourceTextSha256":"42cbde9dad7